{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:9/99/8y0cxood0dkwk7q6bpuwg3ndjjj4jyg.mp3","text":"这是日程表，还有周报、开支表、议程表等待审阅......您想先看哪份？","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e3/p2oinr10v84ba9ucm9tzgk6z5l7xz5t.mp3","text":"通力合作，我们必将披荆斩棘。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/44/3wjm6al3t2isgxond0jhisvxht8lks4.mp3","text":"不介意我整理一下书架吧，长官。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7e/0iqkyvg5m39aek5o2mzf48tv11u6ljr.mp3","text":"人表现出的行为有时和野兽并无区别，了解这份相似性，能够令我更好的履行职责。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f8/nqgbvm5cqgkvnknrlws8xl65upyttt1.mp3","text":"为了欣赏值得观看的东西，我们总要远离城市，这就是我经常远行的原因。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4c/exrra7mhh2bp5lum83wd1k0gujw7ehh.mp3","text":"放置迎宾踏垫只是第一步，如何把猎物引向踏垫才是值得考虑的事。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a3/jampjywffodvfcrg4cl3z9s4w9om4ds.mp3","text":"不不不，这样不对，我再思考一下......","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/65/q6zsa365e96zsqkvisrx7pieiays77p.mp3","text":"有什么我能帮忙的吗？","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/ck1z5jx90xf6btczrut1fj29ybrrppd.mp3","text":"只有自然和战场才能决定谁是猎人，谁是猎物。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:1/10/gl1nz9alotkexw9ja9a769dk0wp549e.mp3","text":"只要在这里拉根细绳，还有一个迎宾踏垫......","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/egn22bjz5mw9do269fq5jv4lp6ddor2.mp3","text":"彩虹小队所属，代号霜华，请下命令吧，长官。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/33/5gmi5fvhaiafvaz1koq2wyi4ogp1xt5.mp3","text":"我有个好点子。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:0/00/rpezy8qvvncp63lnvyxshewc35dpdcg.mp3","text":"感谢您的信任，长官。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cd/6gyzxeesft664c99qnfhet19bjh4und.mp3","text":"在生死攸关之际，我们最迫切渴求的东西莫过于两样：水源，以及希望。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b8/1wqggrl8xgoq2radm9md835uuc4x02s.mp3","text":"让我们一起合作。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:2/29/b6i9acd3z3wo2tn6k2g7ev83bnh4z1a.mp3","text":"别忘了，我们是一个有计划的团队。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/1jdphqjngg0q2vkz3hse308t8irkztn.mp3","text":"是时候看看这些计划的效果了。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:d/df/l4uzezh14yujbhl08damgmfoczii82u.mp3","text":"我看到敌方了。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b5/odsxyq9opro2n6a1ixm6abjh8o9ahjc.mp3","text":"我们准备好迎接客人了。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/91/t9nfyyx39487g5nc7b2jy20yta4gcot.mp3","text":"设置封阻物。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:3/35/n1l8vn1jonw7zdn8vi57qpb45lqteyu.mp3","text":"别让他们偷袭你。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/ej1gfnamhnirmgp4qeoy900jhyqjdv3.mp3","text":"保持警戒。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/6cv45rehkjnp4c8ntj9vl6r8x8cigt2.mp3","text":"摆放迎宾踏垫中。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/s9zprjvuit91wywbszlvxywzvj57bhz.mp3","text":"安装中。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6c/9ql5odeavjtkmzuk6xxxueejnamx9kt.mp3","text":"迎宾踏垫已设置。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/69/2qo3v1gnunzol3ewe87eut3hgcmyiui.mp3","text":"部署完毕。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a3/deb56ilmb6b0b2jjk4v3qccq09wzxub.mp3","text":"每时每刻都要有比敌人更万全的准备。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/lvqt2bqkrih21w0pc88b1rcnpjwerro.mp3","text":"永远记得未雨绸缪。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e2/0xdmorz1ypngylgtwtr42gsp73seo56.mp3","text":"注意周边警戒。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:1/13/8udvvyl67yjoxnadvwsybz134ak64mc.mp3","text":"正在救援，友军受伤。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/ltwliwkl6bjsqomxjp89hggngry04r0.mp3","text":"不是那么坏。","alt":"voice/char_458_rfrost/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwi